duration":8.08,"text":"A single task may involve many"},{"start":92.64,"duration":7.76,"text":"consecutive steps across different"},{"start":97.2,"duration":6.88,"text":"application states. For example, an"},{"start":100.4,"duration":6.08,"text":"agent may open a messaging application,"},{"start":104.08,"duration":5.2,"text":"search it for a content,"},{"start":106.48,"duration":5.68,"text":"retrieve information from another"},{"start":109.28,"duration":7.52,"text":"application, return to the messaging"},{"start":112.16,"duration":7.84,"text":"application, and finally send a message."},{"start":116.8,"duration":6.72,"text":"The security implication of such"},{"start":120.0,"duration":7.28,"text":"behavior cannot always be determined"},{"start":123.52,"duration":5.68,"text":"from an individ."},{"start":127.28,"duration":6.56,"text":"More importantly,"},{"start":129.2,"duration":7.92,"text":"one action is secure or insecure depends"},{"start":133.84,"duration":6.64,"text":"on the active security policy. For"},{"start":137.12,"duration":6.4,"text":"example, sending an account number to a"},{"start":140.48,"duration":7.68,"text":"family member may be allowed on one or"},{"start":143.52,"duration":8.64,"text":"policy but prohibited under a stricter"},{"start":148.16,"duration":6.08,"text":"policy. Therefore, auditing must jointly"},{"start":152.16,"duration":4.88,"text":"reason over the trajetory and the"},{"start":154.24,"duration":6.32,"text":"policy. This creates two key"},{"start":157.04,"duration":6.64,"text":"challengings. First, security reasoning"},{"start":160.56,"duration":7.52,"text":"must consider the four interaction"},{"start":163.68,"duration":8.4,"text":"history rather than isolated actions."},{"start":168.08,"duration":7.76,"text":"Second, the auditor must understand"},{"start":172.08,"duration":5.84,"text":"flexible userdefined policies instead of"},{"start":175.84,"duration":4.48,"text":"relying on"},{"start":177.92,"duration":5.2,"text":"fixed roles."},{"start":180.32,"duration":6.4,"text":"Our goal is therefore to build a"},{"start":183.12,"duration":6.16,"text":"traitary level auditor that gently"},{"start":186.72,"duration":7.32,"text":"reasons over agent behavior and the"},{"start":189.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"nature language security policies."},{"start":194.24,"duration":6.88,"text":"We propose mate a lightweight policy"},{"start":197.52,"duration":6.72,"text":"aware traitory auditor. Mate takes the"},{"start":201.12,"duration":7.36,"text":"three major inputs. The user"},{"start":204.24,"duration":8.56,"text":"instruction, the agent trajectory and an"},{"start":208.48,"duration":6.96,"text":"editable nature language policy."},{"start":212.8,"duration":6.32,"text":"Before auditing, we normalize the"},{"start":215.44,"duration":7.68,"text":"different mobile agent locks into a"},{"start":219.12,"duration":6.96,"text":"unified react representation."},{"start":223.12,"duration":6.08,"text":"Each interaction step contains three"},{"start":226.08,"duration":6.56,"text":"components. thought, action, and"},{"start":229.2,"duration":6.96,"text":"observation. Thought represents the"},{"start":232.64,"duration":8.64,"text":"agent's reasoning or intention."},{"start":236.16,"duration":7.44,"text":"Action describes the actual operating"},{"start":241.28,"duration":6.4,"text":"and the observation captures the"},{"start":243.6,"duration":7.84,"text":"resulting application state."},{"start":247.68,"duration":6.64,"text":"This unifying representation allows mate"},{"start":251.44,"duration":4.8,"text":"to work across different mobile agent"},{"start":254.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"frameworks."},{"start":256.24,"duration":4.64,"text":"Mate then jointly encodes the"},{"start":259.28,"duration":5.04,"text":"instruction,"},{"start":260.88,"duration":7.36,"text":"trajetory and policy and produce three"},{"start":264.32,"duration":7.84,"text":"outposts. a violation in victor, a risk"},{"start":268.24,"duration":7.12,"text":"category and a nature language rational"},{"start":272.16,"duration":5.76,"text":"explaining the decision"},{"start":275.36,"duration":5.76,"text":"to support different efficiency"},{"start":277.92,"duration":6.24,"text":"requirements which the lightweight mate"},{"start":281.12,"duration":7.52,"text":"model at three scales"},{"start":284.16,"duration":6.4,"text":"0.5 billion 1.5 billion and three"},{"start":288.64,"duration":6.24,"text":"billion permits."},{"start":290.56,"duration":6.16,"text":"We also define a mobile agent risk"},{"start":294.88,"duration":5.76,"text":"toxinomy"},{"start":296.72,"duration":5.76,"text":"with three major dominations and 14"},{"start":300.64,"duration":6.56,"text":"subcategories"},{"start":302.48,"duration":7.72,"text":"enabling most drug and interpretable"},{"start":307.2,"duration":3.0,"text":"auditing."},{"start":310.64,"duration":6.8,"text":"The next question is how do we obtain"},{"start":314.08,"duration":6.0,"text":"enough highquality training data?"},{"start":317.44,"duration":6.16,"text":"Large scale mobile agent security"},{"start":320.08,"duration":7.2,"text":"trajectory are difficult and expensive"},{"start":323.6,"duration":7.76,"text":"to collect manually. To address this"},{"start":327.28,"duration":7.52,"text":"problem, our key idea is since it is"},{"start":331.36,"duration":6.8,"text":"driven traitory learning, we first"},{"start":334.8,"duration":5.04,"text":"collect public knowledge about mobile"},{"start":338.16,"duration":4.08,"text":"applications"},{"start":339.84,"duration":3.92,"text":"including mobile application"},{"start":342.24,"duration":3.6,"text":"functionality,"},{"start":343.76,"duration":5.84,"text":"common operation"},{"start":345.84,"duration":5.52,"text":"workflows and the security related"},{"start":349.6,"duration":4.8,"text":"information."},{"start":351.36,"duration":7.28,"text":"This application specific knowledge is"},{"start":354.4,"duration":7.68,"text":"then used to generate executable user